  "details": "The custom laser & menu colors persist when logging out from an account with VRC+ customizations and even when logging into another account that doesn't have VRC+.\n\nImage shows what happened after forcibly being logged out from multiple connection errors (only laser color persisted).\n\n1. Log into an account with VRC+\n\n2. Apply custom UI theme\n\n3. Logout of the account\n\n4. (Optional) Log into a different account without VRC+",
